---
import { expertiseAreas } from '../data/expertise';
import CraftAccordion from './CraftAccordion.astro';
---

<section id="skills" class="craft">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading" data-aos="fade-up">My approach</h2>
    <div class="craft-grid">
      <div class="craft-left" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="craft-intro">
          <p>
            A decade ago, people asked: &ldquo;What is service design?&rdquo; Now a harder question is being asked: as AI reshapes how organisations operate, what does service design actually offer?
          </p>
          <p>
            I find the uncertainty more relevant than the confident predictions. Service design has always worked where strategy meets delivery, where what organisations intend collides with how things actually run. AI transformation is exposing exactly that gap at scale: organisations deploying agents into workflows they never fully understood are finding out the hard way.
          </p>
          <p>
            My approach focuses on surfacing what isn&rsquo;t written down, bridging functions that don&rsquo;t naturally talk to each other, and rebuilding systems around the people inside them. That work is more urgent now, not less, and it&rsquo;s the lens I bring to every project.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="craft-right" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="100">
        <CraftAccordion expertiseAreas={expertiseAreas} />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .craft {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .craft-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap-2xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.4vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    margin: 0 0 var(--gap-xl);
  }

  .craft-intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--gap-lg);
  }

  .craft-intro p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-body-0);
    line-height: var(--line-height-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .craft-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .craft-left {
      position: sticky;
      top: 6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
